    "detailed_description": "<h1>Our games you might like</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760930/extras/d765171bd0a198d770de9103e9d2cde6.avif?t=1733529573\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760930/extras/de579fe5ae6f7f7a1e42794c67123fd2.avif?t=1733529573\" /></div><br><br>Become the new king of cryptocurrency! <strong>Bitcoin Farm</strong> is a clicker game where you will aim to undermine a maximum of Bitcoins! To get there you will first mine Bitcoins with your mouse, then later buy graphics cards or asic miner to mine without doing anything!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760930/extras/9756d3a472c6f18b553ae53ce9a0defe.webp?t=1733529573\" /></div><br><br><strong>Features :</strong><br><br>\u25a0 Pretty decorations!<br>\u25a0 A Bitcoin / Dollar converter!<br>\u25a0 Graphic card shop and asic miner!<br>\u25a0 Background shop!<br>\u25a0 Good music!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/760930/extras/9756d3a472c6f18b553ae53ce9a0defe.webp?t=1733529573\" /></div>",
